!flow-site/tests/
!flow-site/tests/**

# flow-site (Phase 49 Plan 04) docs vitest fixtures — the synthetic [[link]] fixture
# (markdown) must be tracked despite the global `*.md` ignore (RESEARCH Pitfall 7: the
# real wiki has no `[[ ]]` links, so the transform is unit-tested against this fixture).
# The build-time wiki clone at flow-site/src/docs/wiki/ stays ignored (flow-site/.gitignore).
!flow-site/src/lib/docs/__fixtures__/
!flow-site/src/lib/docs/__fixtures__/**

# Pragma companion files for Phase 27 byte-identical determinism gates
# must be tracked despite the global *.flow ignore.
!examples/pragmas/
!examples/pragmas/**
!examples/pragmas/**/*.flow

# Phase 32 Scala tuning tutorial chapter (D-19) — examples/scala/intro.flow
