# tracked despite the global *.flow / *.md ignores above. Mirrors the
# examples/{pragmas,scala,generative,sections,dsp,notation,live}/ + flow-cli/
# Scaffold/ + flow-lang.Tests/Fixtures/ allow-list precedents.
!bench/
!bench/**
!bench/**/*.flow
!bench/**/*.md
!bench/**/*.txt
!bench/run.sh

# Phase 41 JET-01 — the JetBrains plugin CHANGELOG.md is a user-facing release
# artifact and MUST be tracked despite the global *.md ignore above (same
# precedent as flow-jetbrains/README.md, which predates the *.md rule and the
# docs/**/*.md + examples/**/*.md allow-lists). build/ and .gradle/ stay ignored
# via flow-jetbrains/.gitignore.
!flow-jetbrains/CHANGELOG.md

# Re-ignore per-run results files inside bench/ — only the stable-filename
# baseline.txt is tracked. results-<label>-<timestamp>.txt are historical
# artifacts that accumulate per re-run and should not be checked in.
bench/results-*.txt


